dosbox-automation authors
-------------------------

Everyone who contributed to dosbox-automation, by the name they commit
with. The copyright of each contribution stays with its author; the
project's history records who wrote what. Code inherited from DOSBox
Staging and DOSBox keeps its authors in the notices of its files and in
the history. If you want to be named differently, open an issue or a
pull request.

